          "dimension": "Smart-contract / Bridge exploit",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "The HTX/Heco bridge hack and Magpie Protocol attack illustrate that crosschain contracts remain the highest-value attack surface in DeFi, with billions lost historically across bridge exploits.",
